{"seq":3,"slug":"autovacuum-tuning","title":"autovacuum 调参与长事务危害","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/postgresql-performance-operations/vacuum-bloat/autovacuum-tuning","wordCount":2256,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"autovacuum-调参与长事务危害\">autovacuum 调参与长事务危害</h1><p>前面两篇建立了&quot;死元组必须被回收&quot;&quot;膨胀必须被测量与修复&quot;的框架，这一篇解决最后一个环节：<strong>让回收速度跟上产生速度</strong>。这个目标听起来像纯粹的参数调优问题，但生产实践里最常导致失败的原因不是参数，而是<strong>有人持有快照不放</strong>。一个凌晨跑批留下的 <code>idle in transaction</code> 连接，会让 autovacuum 在整库范围内无法推进最老的那条水位线，效果等同于把所有表都按它的年龄冻结。所以这一篇分成两半：先是参数，再是那三类&quot;阻止回收&quot;的元凶。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-autovacuum-的触发公式与默认偏保守问题\">核心概念：autovacuum 的触发公式与默认偏保守问题</h2><p>autovacuum 对每个表独立判断是否该清理，判据是一个阈值公式。对 UPDATE / DELETE 触发的清理：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>threshold</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>autovacuum_vacuum_threshold</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>autovacuum_vacuum_scale_factor</mtext><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>estimated tuples</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{threshold} = \\text{autovacuum\\_vacuum\\_threshold} + \\text{autovacuum\\_vacuum\\_scale\\_factor} \\times N_{\\text{estimated tuples}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">threshold</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">autovacuum_vacuum_threshold</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">autovacuum_vacuum_scale_factor</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">estimated tuples</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>threshold</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>threshold</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> autovacuum_vacuum_max_threshold</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{threshold} = \\min(\\text{threshold},\\ \\text{autovacuum\\_vacuum\\_max\\_threshold})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">threshold</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">threshold</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">autovacuum_vacuum_max_threshold</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>默认值 <code>threshold = 50</code>、<code>scale_factor = 0.2</code>、<code>max_threshold = 100,000,000</code>（PostgreSQL 18 新增的封顶项）。把这个公式代入不同规模的表，就能看出默认值为什么在今天的负载下几乎总是偏保守：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>表行数</th>\n<th>默认阈值</th>\n<th>阈值含义</th>\n<th>问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1 万</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2050</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50 + 0.2 \\times 10^4 = 2050</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2050</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>20% 的行被改过就清理</td>\n<td>对小表过于激进，清理频繁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>100 万</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>050</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50 + 0.2 \\times 10^6 = 200,050</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">050</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>20 万行改动才清理</td>\n<td>合理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1 亿</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>050</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50 + 0.2 \\times 10^8 = 20,000,050</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">050</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><strong>2000 万行改动才清理</strong></td>\n<td>严重偏保守</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10 亿</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>050</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50 + 0.2 \\times 10^9 = 200,000,050</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">050</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>被 <code>max_threshold</code> 封顶到 1 亿</td>\n<td>18 起才被修正</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三行是问题的核心：<strong>比例阈值让表越大越难被清理</strong>。一张 1 亿行的表要累积 2000 万行的改动才触发清理，而清理本身又要扫描 1 亿行——等它终于开始跑时，产生的死元组量已经足够造成明显膨胀。<code>autovacuum_vacuum_max_threshold</code>（18 新增，默认 1 亿）正是为这个缺陷打的补丁：它给阈值加了一个绝对上限，让超大表不再被比例项拖住。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[表发生 UPDATE/DELETE] --&gt; B[累积计数器]&#10;    B --&gt; C{n_dead_tup &gt; threshold?}&#10;    C --&gt;|否| B&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D[autovacuum launcher 派发 worker]&#10;    D --&gt; E{有空闲 worker slot?}&#10;    E --&gt;|否| F[排队等待&lt;br/&gt;autovacuum_worker_slots]&#10;    E --&gt;|是| G[开始 VACUUM]&#10;    G --&gt; H[受 cost delay 节流]&#10;    H --&gt; I{有老快照挡路?}&#10;    I --&gt;|是| J[只回收到最老快照之前&lt;br/&gt;relfrozenxid 无法前进]&#10;    I --&gt;|否| K[回收全部死元组&lt;br/&gt;更新 visibility map]&#10;    K --&gt; L[表可复用空间]\">graph TD\n    A[表发生 UPDATE/DELETE] --&gt; B[累积计数器]\n    B --&gt; C{n_dead_tup &gt; threshold?}\n    C --&gt;|否| B\n    C --&gt;|是| D[autovacuum launcher 派发 worker]\n    D --&gt; E{有空闲 worker slot?}\n    E --&gt;|否| F[排队等待&lt;br/&gt;autovacuum_worker_slots]\n    E --&gt;|是| G[开始 VACUUM]\n    G --&gt; H[受 cost delay 节流]\n    H --&gt; I{有老快照挡路?}\n    I --&gt;|是| J[只回收到最老快照之前&lt;br/&gt;relfrozenxid 无法前进]\n    I --&gt;|否| K[回收全部死元组&lt;br/&gt;更新 visibility map]\n    K --&gt; L[表可复用空间]</pre><p>另一个默认偏保守的原因是节流机制。autovacuum 受代价延时（cost delay）控制：它会累积&quot;代价分&quot;，达到 <code>autovacuum_vacuum_cost_limit</code>（默认 200，等效继承 <code>vacuum_cost_limit</code>）后睡眠 <code>autovacuum_vacuum_cost_delay</code>（默认 2ms）。这个机制的设计目标是避免 autovacuum 把 I/O 打满，但在 SSD 与 NVMe 时代 2ms 的休眠显得过于谨慎。更重要的是：<strong><code>autovacuum_vacuum_cost_limit</code> 是全体 autovacuum worker 共享的</strong>，所以 worker 越多，每个 worker 分到的限额越少——这解释了为什么简单调大 <code>autovacuum_max_workers</code> 常常没有效果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"参数调整-按顺序的四步\">参数调整：按顺序的四步</h2><p>调参的正确顺序不是&quot;把所有数字调大&quot;，而是先定位瓶颈在哪一环：</p>\n<p><strong>第一步：确认 worker 够不够。</strong> 看 <code>pg_stat_activity</code> 里 <code>backend_type = &#39;autovacuum worker&#39;</code> 的数量，以及是否有表长期在等待。PostgreSQL 18 引入了 <code>autovacuum_worker_slots</code>（默认预留 16 个 backend slot），它把 autovacuum worker 从&quot;与普通连接抢 slot&quot;的竞争中隔离出来。如果 <code>max_connections</code> 长期高位，这个参数是必须检查的——旧版本里 autovacuum 拿不到 slot 会直接停摆，症状是&quot;所有表的 <code>last_autovacuum</code> 都很久以前&quot;。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"conf\" data-code=\"# postgresql.conf（需重启）&#10;autovacuum_worker_slots = 16&#10;autovacuum_max_workers = 6\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># postgresql.conf（需重启）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>autovacuum_worker_slots = 16</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>autovacuum_max_workers = 6</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>第二步：处理大表的比例阈值。</strong> 对行数超过千万的表，逐表设置更激进的参数，而不是全局调整：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"ALTER TABLE public.orders SET (&#10;  autovacuum_vacuum_scale_factor = 0.02,&#10;  autovacuum_vacuum_threshold = 5000,&#10;  autovacuum_vacuum_max_threshold = 2000000,&#10;  autovacuum_vacuum_cost_delay = 1,&#10;  autovacuum_analyze_scale_factor = 0.005&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ALTER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> public</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">orders</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  autovacuum_vacuum_scale_factor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">02</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  autovacuum_vacuum_threshold </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  autovacuum_vacuum_max_threshold </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2000000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  autovacuum_vacuum_cost_delay </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  autovacuum_analyze_scale_factor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">005</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这里 <code>scale_factor</code> 从 0.2 降到 0.02 是最主要的一步，它让表在 2% 的行被改动时就触发清理，而不是 20%。<code>max_threshold</code> 则给绝对上限兜底。<strong>注意</strong>：这些表级参数会覆盖全局默认值，因此表结构变更（如 <code>ALTER TABLE</code> 重建）后需要确认它们还在。</p>\n<p><strong>第三步：评估 cost delay 是否需要放宽。</strong> 判断依据是 I/O 是否有余量。如果存储是本地 NVMe 且 <code>pg_stat_io</code> 显示 <code>context = &#39;vacuum&#39;</code> 的 <code>read_time</code> 平均值很低，把延时降下来是明显的正收益：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"conf\" data-code=\"autovacuum_vacuum_cost_delay = 1ms      # 默认 2ms，可降到 0-1ms&#10;autovacuum_vacuum_cost_limit = 2000     # 默认 200，注意是 worker 间共享&#10;maintenance_work_mem = 1GB              # 加速每个 worker 的扫描\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>autovacuum_vacuum_cost_delay = 1ms      # 默认 2ms，可降到 0-1ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>autovacuum_vacuum_cost_limit = 2000     # 默认 200，注意是 worker 间共享</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>maintenance_work_mem = 1GB              # 加速每个 worker 的扫描</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>maintenance_work_mem</code> 在这里的作用容易被低估：它决定 VACUUM 能一次在内存里记住多少死元组位置（TID 列表）。当内存不够时，VACUUM 必须多次遍历索引来删除死条目，这是 VACUUM 慢的主要原因之一。调大到 1–2GB 对索引多的表效果显著。</p>\n<p><strong>第四步：分析（ANALYZE）的相关参数。</strong> autovacuum 也负责自动分析，它的阈值公式与 VACUUM 平行（<code>autovacuum_analyze_threshold</code> 默认 50，<code>autovacuum_analyze_scale_factor</code> 默认 0.1）。分析滞后会让优化器的行数估算失真，进而选错连接方式与访问路径——这个问题在 <a href=\"../indexes-queries/query-tuning-patterns\">常见查询反模式与调优套路</a> 里会作为一类根因出现。对数据分布倾斜的表，除了调低这两个值，还应考虑 <code>CREATE STATISTICS</code> 创建扩展统计信息。</p>\n<h2 id=\"长事务-为什么它是万恶之源\">长事务：为什么它是万恶之源</h2><p>参数调到最优，一个持久的快照仍然能让所有努力失效。原因在第一篇讲过：可见性判定需要知道&quot;快照边界&quot;，而回收只能回收到最老活跃快照之前。<strong>一个事务持有的快照年龄，就是整库回收水位的上限。</strong></p>\n<p>三类元凶按出现频率排列：</p>\n<p><strong>元凶一：<code>idle in transaction</code> 连接。</strong> 这是最常见也最容易修复的一类。应用或人工开了事务，做了一些操作后开始等待外部事件（HTTP 调用、消息队列、甚至只是忘了提交），连接状态是 <code>idle in transaction</code>，事务未结束，快照被持有。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 找出所有持有老快照的会话&#10;SELECT pid,&#10;       now() - xact_start AS xact_age,&#10;       now() - state_change AS idle_age,&#10;       state, wait_event_type, wait_event,&#10;       left(query, 60) AS query&#10;FROM pg_stat_activity&#10;WHERE xact_start IS NOT NULL&#10;  AND state &lt;&gt; &#39;idle&#39;&#10;ORDER BY xact_start ASC;&#10;&#10;-- 找出 idle in transaction 的&#10;SELECT pid, now() - xact_start AS xact_age, left(query, 60)&#10;FROM pg_stat_activity&#10;WHERE state = &#39;idle in transaction&#39;&#10;ORDER BY xact_start ASC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 找出所有持有老快照的会话</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pid,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> xact_start </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> xact_age,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> state_change </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idle_age,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       state</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, wait_event_type, wait_event,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       left</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(query, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> query</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pg_stat_activity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> xact_start </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'idle'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> xact_start </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ASC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 找出 idle in transaction 的</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pid, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> xact_start </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> xact_age, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">left</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(query, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pg_stat_activity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'idle in transaction'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> xact_start </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ASC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>第一段查询的过滤条件是 <code>state &lt;&gt; &#39;idle&#39;</code> 而不是 <code>state = &#39;active&#39;</code>——因为 <code>idle in transaction</code> 才是问题所在，而 <code>active</code> 的长查询虽然也持快照，但至少在做实事。第二段查询专门抓这一类。</p>\n<p>根治手段是配置层的一道保险：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"conf\" data-code=\"idle_in_transaction_session_timeout = &#39;5min&#39;&#10;statement_timeout = &#39;30s&#39;&#10;lock_timeout = &#39;10s&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>idle_in_transaction_session_timeout = '5min'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>statement_timeout = '30s'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>lock_timeout = '10s'</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>idle_in_transaction_session_timeout</code> 会自动终止这类连接，是投入产出比最高的一个配置。需要注意的是它是<strong>会话级强制</strong>，会破坏那些合法依赖长事务的应用模式（比如应用自己实现的两阶段提交式流程），所以上线前要确认应用侧没有这种用法。正因如此，它必须与代码规范一起推进：<strong>任何应用都不该在事务中等待用户输入或外部网络调用</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>元凶二：长查询与 <code>pg_dump</code>。</strong> 一个跑 40 分钟的分析查询同样持有快照。它的危害范围与长事务相同，但因为它在 &quot;干活&quot;，更容易被容忍。治理方式是把它导向备库或在设计上避免全表扫描——这类查询通常可以通过加索引或改写降级为几十秒。</p>\n<p><strong>元凶三：停滞的逻辑复制槽。</strong> 逻辑复制槽会保留&quot;还没被消费的 WAL&quot;，并且订阅端在应用变更时持有快照。一个被禁用或长期无订阅者消费的复制槽会同时导致 WAL 无限堆积（磁盘打满）和回收受阻。这与物理复制不同——物理复制用的 <code>wal_keep_size</code> 是软上限，而复制槽是硬保留：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT slot_name, slot_type, active,&#10;       pg_size_pretty(pg_wal_lsn_diff(pg_current_wal_lsn(), restart_lsn)) AS retained_wal,&#10;       wal_status, safe_wal_size&#10;FROM pg_replication_slots&#10;ORDER BY pg_wal_lsn_diff(pg_current_wal_lsn(), restart_lsn) DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> slot_name, slot_type, active,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       pg_size_pretty(pg_wal_lsn_diff(pg_current_wal_lsn(), restart_lsn)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> retained_wal,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       wal_status, safe_wal_size</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pg_replication_slots</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pg_wal_lsn_diff(pg_current_wal_lsn(), restart_lsn) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>wal_status</code> 字段（PostgreSQL 13 引入）是这里的核心判断：<code>reserved</code> 表示在 <code>max_wal_size</code> 内，<code>extended</code> 表示超出但仍在 <code>max_slot_wal_keep_size</code> 内，<code>unreserved</code> 表示即将被回收（槽会失效、订阅端必须重新同步），<code>lost</code> 表示已经失效。设置 <code>max_slot_wal_keep_size</code> 让 PostgreSQL 在复制槽堆积到阈值时自动让槽失效，是一个必要的防护——它把&quot;磁盘被打满导致整库不可用&quot;换成&quot;复制槽失效需要重同步&quot;，后者是可恢复的故障。复制槽的运维细节见 <a href=\"../ha-operations/streaming-logical-replication\">流复制、同步复制与逻辑复制</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"观测-把三件事放到一个看板上\">观测：把三件事放到一个看板上</h2><p>治理 autovacuum 需要有持续观测，而不是等出事才查。最小可用的四项指标：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>查询</th>\n<th>阈值建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最老快照年龄</td>\n<td><code>max(age(backend_xmin))</code> on <code>pg_stat_activity</code></td>\n<td>&gt; 1h 就该告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事务号年龄百分比</td>\n<td><code>max(age(datfrozenxid)) / 2e9</code> on <code>pg_database</code></td>\n<td>&gt; 20% 关注，&gt; 50% 立即处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>死元组比例</td>\n<td><code>n_dead_tup / (n_live_tup + n_dead_tup)</code> per table</td>\n<td>&gt; 20% 就该看 autovacuum 日志</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复制槽保留 WAL</td>\n<td><code>pg_wal_lsn_diff</code> per slot</td>\n<td>接近 <code>max_slot_wal_keep_size</code> 告警</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>配合 <code>log_autovacuum_min_duration = 0</code>（或一个较小值如 250ms）让每次 autovacuum 都留下日志行，日志里包含扫描页数、移除元组数、耗时、buffer 命中情况——这是判断&quot;autovacuum 是不是在做有效工作&quot;最直接的证据。如果日志显示一张表被反复 VACUUM 但每次只移除很少的元组，说明有老快照在挡路，参数调到再激进也没用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>autovacuum 的触发阈值是 <code>threshold + scale_factor × 行数</code>，比例项让大表越来越难被清理；18 新增 <code>autovacuum_vacuum_max_threshold</code>（默认 1 亿）为超大表封顶。</li>\n<li>调参顺序：先确认 worker slot 够用（18 的 <code>autovacuum_worker_slots</code>）→ 对大表逐表降低 <code>scale_factor</code> → 评估放宽 cost delay 与调大 <code>maintenance_work_mem</code> → 同时关注 ANALYZE 参数。</li>\n<li><code>autovacuum_vacuum_cost_limit</code> 是全体 worker 共享的，因此单纯调大 worker 数量常无效果。</li>\n<li>长事务、<code>idle in transaction</code>、停滞的逻辑复制槽三者都会持有快照，把整库的可回收水位钉住；参数调到最优也无法绕过。</li>\n<li><code>idle_in_transaction_session_timeout</code> 是投入产出比最高的单项配置，但它需要代码规范配合（不在事务中等待外部事件）。</li>\n<li><code>max_slot_wal_keep_size</code> 把&quot;复制槽堆满磁盘导致整库不可用&quot;换成&quot;复制槽失效需重同步&quot;，是必要的防护取舍。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"autovacuum 调参与长事务危害","id":"autovacuum-调参与长事务危害"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：autovacuum 的触发公式与默认偏保守问题","id":"核心概念-autovacuum-的触发公式与默认偏保守问题"},{"level":2,"text":"参数调整：按顺序的四步","id":"参数调整-按顺序的四步"},{"level":2,"text":"长事务：为什么它是万恶之源","id":"长事务-为什么它是万恶之源"},{"level":2,"text":"观测：把三件事放到一个看板上","id":"观测-把三件事放到一个看板上"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"表 / 索引膨胀诊断与 pg_repack 在线重建","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/postgresql-performance-operations/vacuum-bloat/bloat-repack"},"next":{"title":"索引家族：B-tree/GIN/GiST/BRIN/HASH 的选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/postgresql-performance-operations/indexes-queries/index-family-choice"}}